.TH quarters-shortcut 1  "quarters-shortcut " 
.SH NAME
quarters\-shortcut \- Inspect or manage a short command that resolves to Quarters
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquarters\-shortcut\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Inspect or manage a short command that resolves to Quarters
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
quarters\-shortcut\-status(1)
Inspect command resolution without changing it
.TP
quarters\-shortcut\-install(1)
Install a non\-overwriting managed shortcut
.TP
quarters\-shortcut\-remove(1)
Remove only a verified Quarters\-managed shortcut
.TP
quarters\-shortcut\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
